WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.000
Narrator: Feelings spread through a crowd like a ripple.

2
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:05.700
Narrator: Joy after a goal.

3
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:08.000
Narrator: Anger after a decision.

4
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:11.600
Narrator: Fear after a sudden noise or a push.

5
00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:14.400
Narrator: It takes seconds.

6
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.300
Narrator: The good news: your calm spreads too.

7
00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:26.000
Narrator: And remember - people moving away from danger are doing the natural thing and most will help each other.

8
00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:30.400
Narrator: They need clear, calm directions.

